<title>MEXICO: Codumex to request delisting.</title>
<headline>Codumex to request delisting.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Condumex SA de CV (Codumex) announced on Tuesday that its shareholders would hold an extraordinary assembly to decide whether or not to delist the company on the Mexican Stock Exchange (BMV).</p>
<p>The announcement, put out by the BMV, said that, if the motion was passed, the company would request permission to be delisted by the National Banking and Securities Commission.</p>
<p>Condumex, based in Mexico City, is a maker of copper cable.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9552</p>
